474 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Resilience enables project managers to confront these issues head-on, devise solutions, and adjust course as necessary without losing focus on the overall project goals. Resilience is a fundamental skill for project managers because it equips them to handle the inevitable challenges and setbacks that arise in any project. This capacity to adapt and recover from difficulties not only helps maintain project momentum but also inspires confidence within the team. )
/E (Resilience enables project managers to confront these issues head-on, devise solutions, and adjust course as necessary without losing focus on the overall project goals. Resilience is a fundamental skill for project managers because it equips them to handle the inevitable challenges and setbacks that arise in any project. This capacity to adapt and recover from difficulties not only helps maintain project momentum but also inspires confidence within the team. )
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
475 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (In essence, resilience empowers project managers to manage not only the technical aspects of a project but also the human and emotional complexities that are inevitable in dynamic project environments. This skill is indispensable for ensuring that both the project and the people driving it forward can thrive, even under pressure.)
/E (In essence, resilience empowers project managers to manage not only the technical aspects of a project but also the human and emotional complexities that are inevitable in dynamic project environments. This skill is indispensable for ensuring that both the project and the people driving it forward can thrive, even under pressure.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [5]
>>
