/ActualText (Through a holistic approach, I assist organizations in unleashing their workforce's full potential by fostering a culture of continuous learning and development. Prioritizing work-life balance and well-being, I empower individuals to thrive both personally and professionally, creating a harmonious and productive work environment. I aim to inspire others to embrace their talents and achieve their full potential by sharing timeless wisdom and practical strategies. Contact me at major@prebagaran.my to share your thoughts and questions. Thank you.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [2]
